<title>JAPAN: Iwasaki Electric -97/98 group forecast.</title>
<headline>Iwasaki Electric -97/98 group forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1998</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			  12-MONTH	   FOUR-MONTH</p>
<p> (Group)		TO MARCH 98	TO MARCH 97</p>
<p> Sales		 72.90		24.04</p>
<p> Current		1.50	     218    mln</p>
<p> Net		  750    mln	  65    mln</p>
<p> EPS		    9.46 yen	   0.82 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Iwasaki Electric Co Ltd makes illumination lamps.</p>
<p>It had no full-year comparison as the company changed its business year to end March from the previous November.</p>
